stream
BT /F2 16 Tf 54 723 Td (Lumen Sales Playbook: Water Utilities) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 701 Td (Document ID: sales-lumen-water-utilities-playbook | Version: 1 | Effective: 2025-05-06 | Owner:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 688 Td (Sales Enablement, Lumen segment) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 663 Td (1. Why water utilities) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 641 Td (Water utilities are the largest single segment for the Lumen range, accounting for roughly 45%) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628 Td (of Lumen unit volume in FY2024/25. The typical buyer is a regional water company or municipal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 615 Td (water authority replacing mechanical and older electromagnetic meters at pumping stations,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 602 Td (district metered areas \(DMAs\), treatment works and reservoir outlets. Budgets are driven by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 589 Td (leakage reduction targets, regulatory reporting and asset renewal programmes that run on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 576 Td (five-year cycles.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 554 Td (Lumen wins in this segment on three points: no moving parts and no pressure loss, a full-bore) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 541 Td (design that tolerates the occasional debris found in raw water mains, and good accuracy at low) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 528 Td (velocities where night-flow analysis matters for leakage detection.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 503 Td (2. Qualification questions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 481 Td (Ask these on the first call. They decide whether the opportunity is real and which model to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 468 Td (propose.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 446 Td (- What is the maximum operating pressure of the line, including surge? Anything above 16 bar) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 433 Td (   rules out the LF-60.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 420 Td (- What is the pipe size? The LF-60 covers DN25 to DN200; the LF-60P stops at DN150.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 407 Td (- What is the fluid temperature range? Treated and raw water is almost always within the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 394 Td (   LF-60 range of -10 to +80 \260C.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 381 Td (- Will the meter be installed in a chamber or pit that can flood? The LF-60 is IP65; flooded) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 368 Td (   chambers need the IP67 LF-60P or a remote-mount kit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 355 Td (- Does the SCADA or telemetry system use Modbus RTU, HART, or plain 4-20 mA and pulse? HART) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 342 Td (   is only available on the LF-60P.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 329 Td (- How much straight pipe is available? The LF-60 needs 10D upstream and 5D downstream; the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 316 Td (   LF-60P needs 15D upstream.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 303 Td (- What is the lowest expected flow velocity, for example during night flow? Both models) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 290 Td (   measure down to 0.1 m/s.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 277 Td (- Is the meter used for billing or regulatory reporting, and which accuracy class is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 264 Td (   specified?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 251 Td (- Who approves the product list: the utility's asset standards team, the contractor or a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 238 Td (   framework agreement?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 225 Td (- When does the current capital programme period end?) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 209 Td (3. LF-60 or LF-60P) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 187 Td (Default to the LF-60 for water utilities. Most distribution mains, DMA inlets and reservoir) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 174 Td (outlets operate below 10 bar, at ambient water temperatures, in dry kiosks or above-ground) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 161 Td (valve houses. The LF-60 meets those conditions at a lower price.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 139 Td (Propose the LF-60P when any of the following apply:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 117 Td (- Operating or surge pressure above 16 bar, typical of high-lift pumping stations and trunk) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 104 Td (   mains in hilly terrain.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 91 Td (- Installation in chambers that flood, where IP67 is needed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 78 Td (- The customer's asset management standard requires HART diagnostics.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 65 Td (- The customer wants the tighter \2610.75% accuracy for revenue or abstraction licence) Tj ET
endstream
