6 0 obj
<< /Length 3684 >>
stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (   metering.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td (- Very cold exposed sites where the ambient can fall below -20 \260C.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 703 Td (Propose the LF-60 when the line is DN200; the LF-60P is not available above DN150.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 681 Td (Do not propose either model for sludge, grit-laden raw water or any fluid with high solids) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 668 Td (content. Optical correlation needs a reasonably clear fluid; refer those enquiries to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 655 Td (application engineering team in Rotterdam.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 630 Td (4. Objection handling) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 608 Td ("Electromagnetic meters are the utility standard." Agree that they are proven. Point out that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 595 Td (Lumen meters also work on non-conductive fluids such as very low conductivity treated water and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 582 Td (demineralised water, and that the optical principle does not depend on fluid conductivity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 569 Td (Offer a side-by-side trial against the incumbent meter.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 547 Td ("Optical windows will foul." Explain that on clean potable water the window inspection interval) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 534 Td (is 12 months at most and often longer, that the meter reports signal quality continuously over) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 521 Td (Modbus register 30017, and that the L-218 warning gives early notice before accuracy is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 508 Td (affected.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 486 Td ("Your price is higher than a mechanical meter." Move the conversation to whole-life cost: no) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 473 Td (moving parts to wear, no recalibration, no pressure loss and therefore lower pumping energy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 460 Td (The Lumen TCO worksheet on the sales enablement site shows typical payback periods.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 438 Td ("We need a meter that our technicians already know." Offer a half-day installation workshop,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 425 Td (delivered by the Rotterdam application team or a certified partner, covering installation,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 412 Td (grounding and commissioning.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 387 Td (5. Pricing and commercial terms) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 365 Td (Do not quote prices from this playbook. Use the current hardware price list) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 352 Td (\(sales-price-list-fy25-26\) for list prices in GBP, EUR, USD and MYR, and follow the discount) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 339 Td (approval matrix \(sales-discount-approval-matrix\) for any discount. Framework agreements with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 326 Td (utilities frequently require fixed pricing for three to five years; any price hold beyond the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 313 Td (current financial year needs approval from the regional sales manager.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 291 Td (Utilities usually expect a support contract. Position the Professional support tier as the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 278 Td (default for utilities, because its advance replacement option keeps DMA metering online during) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 265 Td (an RMA.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 240 Td (6. Proof points and references) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 218 Td (- A UK water company replaced 140 mechanical meters at DMA inlets with LF-60 meters in 2024) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 205 Td (   and reported a clearer picture of night flows within three months.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 192 Td (- A Malaysian state water operator uses LF-60P meters on high-lift pumping station) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 179 Td (   discharges running at 22 bar.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 166 Td (Ask the Lumen product team for approval before naming any customer in a proposal.) Tj ET
endstream
